      <rules>
        <rule name="Berserkers" id="2038-9231-948c-4ffc" hidden="false">
          <description>Forest Goblins of the Red Toof tribe allow themselves to be bitten by all sorts of poisonous wildlife before entering battle.


The mingling venom drives them into frothing convulsions, making them extremely ferocious.
Red Toof Boyz are affected by the rules for Frenzy as described in the Mordheim rulebook.


In addition, if they begin their turn within charge range of an enemy, they are immune to animosity for that turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
